# D-105 native (steps/d105-native.md §4; the author's Q39: "сначала в интерпретаторе и потом нативно"): a field of the
# unit, `g: Other`, passed from a method to `rd (Model: m)`: 10.  Success is 7.
Model:
    size_t: a 1U
    size_t: b 2U
end: Model
Other:
    size_t: b 20U
    size_t: a 10U
end: Other
Other: g
fn: rd (Model: m) size_t
return: m\a
fn: go () size_t
    return: rd(g)
size_t: got 0U
got: go()
int: ok 3
if: got = 10U
    ok: 7
if: got = 20U
    ok: 5
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: ok; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
